    Complete hyperparameters for all components (LLM backbone, training pipeline, graph neural 1 network, agent LoRAs) are tabulated in Supplementary Table S8. Training proceeds through a 2 four-stage pipeline: pretraining on seven representation-learning tasks, adapter merging to 3 produce the OCellus-Pretrain checkpoint, multi-task fine-tuning on twenty-two tasks, and a final 4 merge to produce the OCellus checkpoint used throughout this paper. Total wall time is 35.5 5 hours on four NVIDIA A800-80GB GPUs, with a final training loss of 0.6649. The full training 6 specification, including GPU-memory optimization and data preprocessing decisions, appears in 7 Methods and Supplementary Figure S1. 8
