    is more than the fifteen primary tools counted in the main text -the difference reflects category-level groupings versus individual function listings. A retry feedback arrow from the Verifier back to the Planner is shown. (b) Ablation results on eighty trials (twenty natural-language queries times four datasets): pipeline accuracy for OCellus-Agent full (75.0 percent, 60 of 80), without Layer-3 Critic (58.8 percent, 47 of 80), without all Verifier layers (51.3 percent, 41 of 80), without LoRA switching forcing the base model on all tasks (42.5 percent, 34 of 80), and flat ReAct loop without the Coordinator directedacyclic-graph decomposition (51.3 percent, 41 of 80). Each component contributes meaningfully to the final performance.
  </text>
  <text>
    <location value="60"/>
    <location value="188"/>
    <location value="448"/>
